{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1374.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"c6cc2841db6d189365955346b4bffa3de125389a33323141f41fa6f4b3095db0","ja":"みんなを照らすために","zh":"为了照亮大家","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1374.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"ebde59ef5eee63151740d19d34daee07a93155476b5d5e00fccc6b8c9b1a0e12","ja":"みんな、おつかれちゃ～ん！\n熱気ムンムンで、め～ちゃ熱いステージだったね♪","zh":"大家辛苦啦～！\n现场气氛热气腾腾，舞台可～真是太燃了呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1374.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"4a2ae2c16c9f04f91e16ffa359949d501e8997b3b344ff1da364750e954d4387","ja":"真美たちが太陽みたいに、\nアッツアツに盛り上げたおかげっしょ～♪","zh":"多亏真美我们像太阳一样，\n把气氛炒得热火朝天吧～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1374.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"ae2836d57edeba93194ef8e2be4e5516ca90baa3e8c3c4e4ac873f101531f734","ja":"えへへ♪　私も盛り上がって\nい～っぱい汗かいちゃったなーって！","zh":"嘿嘿♪　我也跟着嗨了起来，\n流了好多好多汗呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1374.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"29ffa6375c8fcc99ea7cb290b624727bf303e77cb163684d445ff4882194f454","ja":"汗はちゃんと拭いておくのよ。ツアーは\nまだまだ続くんだし、体調管理も大事なんだから。","zh":"记得要把汗好好擦掉哦。毕竟巡演\n还要继续好一阵子，管理好身体状况也很重要。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1374.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"a5b4f6a0042584dd14d06efcb8a8afdbb89cb1bf748dbc4a891d80887faa2a1d","ja":"ミキも、いっぱい頑張ったから疲れちゃったの。","zh":"美希也很努力了，所以累坏了呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1374.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"0c707f68f95475f909a9b1e15432d8b581cbb4aab803ac53ee7d585f04d0e682","ja":"いいパフォーマンスしてたものね。\n今日は早く帰って、ゆっくり休んで……。","zh":"表演得真棒呢。\n今天早点回去，好好休息吧……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1374.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"f405f0bee90c1aad7ff51af6d34d391deb48cad339eb0059a09fa6f11ca602d8","ja":"えー、そんなのつまんないの！","zh":"诶～，那样好无聊嘛！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1374.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"7a6f2db7fc75e99058f447758667435e7695a6c3ed48a1da5b8434241ffadaf9","ja":"ミキ的には、体調管理のために\n甘いもの食べに行きたいって思うな☆","zh":"美希觉得，为了管理好身体状况，\n应该去吃点甜食呢☆","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1374.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"df3cdcf984f8fa6afca2c4d72ae9c17ff17cebbe0b67a3b326b5f13d796ceea7","ja":"私も、ちょっと甘い物食べたいかもです。","zh":"我也稍微有点想吃甜食了呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1374.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"85620cddb542b455147f29cb08a131f8c311494506d64d951a6ef602d9941541","ja":"亜美的にも、甘い物を食べないと、\n次のライブはがんばれないって思うな☆","zh":"亚美也觉得，要是不吃点甜食，\n下一场演出就没法加油了呢☆","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1374.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"be9d705dcf7efae2a4e8bc602054dab653e17264bb1a43c7e98be2a83ed4c434","ja":"タイチョー管理のためなら仕方ないよね～。\nってことで、みんなでレッツゴー♪","zh":"为了管理好身体状况，也是没办法的嘛～。\n所以说，大家一起出发吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1374.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"4eb5a7d19767631d702facaaf7829b8e0268a862f53c41ae8d096e4ece864223","ja":"ちょっと待ちなさい！　この前もTV収録の後、\nスイーツ食べたじゃない！","zh":"等一下！之前电视节目录制结束后，\n你不是也吃甜点了吗！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1374.unity3d","item_key":"commands[41].text","source_sha256":"578568f741db99d56f53a1cdefa38006a84f68687d9a5f2503ca06527c2a0ca8","ja":"何かあるたびに食べてたらキリがないし、\r\n食べ過ぎたらステージにも支障が……。","zh":"遇到什么事都吃的话就没完没了了，\n要是吃太多，在舞台上也会有影响……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1374.unity3d","item_key":"commands[50].text","source_sha256":"32521b94eb078ff4d8927fee9bd47e19cc2c935cbe4060404249e624d689e244","ja":"え～っ！　亜美、もうヘトヘトなのに～！　スイーツ\n食べない方が、次のステージにシショーがでるよ～！","zh":"诶～！亚美已经筋疲力尽了耶～！要是不吃\n甜点的话，下一场舞台上可就要出大问题了哦～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1374.unity3d","item_key":"commands[51].text","source_sha256":"f143426e9a6e5f102dbfc005ae563cbc6ca959a43ae45a4f1a4d0029aaefe221","ja":"真美たちは『ソル』なんだよ？\nみんなを照らすには、エネルギーが必要っしょ！！","zh":"真美我们可是“太阳”哦？\n想要照亮大家，就得补充能量对吧！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1374.unity3d","item_key":"commands[60].text","source_sha256":"4e864be238fdbb42b045e0532c3c683feef474a09d8ab1cb94d4bffeebc94c7f","ja":"な、なんだかふたりの言うことにも一理あるわね……\nわかったわ、でも食べ過ぎはダメだからね！","zh":"总、总觉得你们两个说的也挺有道理的呢……\n我知道了，但可不能吃太多哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
